      "target_id": "XML:1802993",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》施行细则〔附表格式第8号〕<2021年7月12日新增>"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "b736160e9f7f0d321a2b458369e87ad0a76a9b7c00b4454ad463a28ce8d1d95b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802996",
      "text": "受理编号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "ebc9b96eb63cf003b7b1fc13d77fd353ced43869ee6c7836a9f3be4c588e1391",
      "target_id": "XML:1802997",
      "text": "受理日期"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "d18875e1fa5508fbd63ab68f1bdc871134b418fb8069e19c5a5d3b64327c2254",
      "target_id": "XML:1802998",
      "text": "请求人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "9444b0a00a812f655b27d369eb4c26c19b67484b28bc7411ca01f82e11d76532",
      "target_id": "XML:1802999",
      "text": "法人名称（姓名）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "7e53d842dd0fd3a5f45f9a5162eb0ddefccb0e462c2c1c38b1e4f0d5a81dd547",
      "target_id": "XML:1803000",
      "text": "营业（法人）登记号码"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "7bdbbfa1a6f2c065dc71d6c5479f207830048667134efede03f4a3beb9b42c68",
      "target_id": "XML:1803003",
      "text": "代表人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "6bbece9c5ef3ae2e9c58112983d42dd269183ed34a6469e684ac1ef0fd34ecf4",
      "target_id": "XML:1803013",
      "text": "※ 请具体填写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "68f344a77923b886f9cabd44b0337123cdd0d9fb43cb03e3689e31cefa2266a7",
      "target_id": "XML:1803014",
      "text": "请求事项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "c498e7b34da54d5d7d70d369f0cddf627cbdd5a2104748634c95cc910cf6cf9c",
      "target_id": "XML:1803015",
      "text": "已完成修订的法规"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "8f14b2a14b51bc382aac8547cd4d44bbbe25d82a2018dfd52194d90098887673",
      "target_id": "XML:1803016",
      "text": "需要修订的法规"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "7e6c55ef4f2f07169154847f46fa85e9b3c14a5b39031abdc144a24a189f04b4",
      "target_id": "XML:1803017",
      "text": "其他需要修订的法规"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "e3b201e331d23a3482fb9c26b5d2d57eb80ff9386857a68cb96a0a414da52240",
      "target_id": "XML:1803018",
      "text": "需要修订法令的理由"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "b98810347a861636351ede9c49d30bd43ea9245047828fcb502909d6cbb19d66",
      "target_id": "XML:1803019",
      "text": "根据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第53条之3第3款、同法施行令第58条之3第3款及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "15e83331482e4c24c79e925ffa9f540cf6db7889cbda5f644ae63de8a867037e",
      "target_id": "XML:1803020",
      "text": "同法施行细则第6条第1款，特此请求进行上述法令整备。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "3c87bba5d1228cdd2a43225dd346909393d53965942a1d281ac1b3a01d2581ec",
      "target_id": "XML:1803024",
      "text": "请求人姓名"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "1bb47a2591dabb25b9d28b6fa8980630dc00d03d8797150a0606ae968d76bf8c",
      "target_id": "XML:1803026",
      "text": "国土交通部长官及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "2099cd7f323c38ac89f0ebc4dd140529ccb048fb87aa42935038b81b0325020d",
      "target_id": "XML:1803027",
      "text": "（收件人）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "bc8336f874ce4d42a89f748ca8a9fd505f978dd7421d75bbecd563766fb90ff2",
      "target_id": "XML:1803028",
      "text": "有关中央行政机关负责人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "fd2f47ef0e382c62edaf27036494fbc803f503705144e1049d1463aadda6388b",
      "target_id": "XML:1803029",
      "text": "附件材料"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "2705c00772461748664a988ca233dc34eb936426bb6fb9cdb4e8448f8cb594ed",
      "target_id": "XML:1803030",
      "text": "1. 是否已实现智能示范项目计划的目标"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "53b6e9e6c6b295ffd53d88933443414fc9b6c87a6e84de435a6b648f147b99a8",
      "target_id": "XML:1803031",
      "text": "2. 是否履行智能示范项目计划所附条件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25472-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "a7b7f4eead2658008962f93491705d076ccf0abcf12a91d930aa476cc3865d14",
      "target_id": "XML:1803032",
      "text": "3. 居民等是否发生损害、是否已获损害赔偿及采取措施的结果"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "2a55e21b90e0a92898e3cff1fb37feb1ca04338af3a1552a813038c1cc0ee229",
      "target_id": "XML:1803035",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》施行细则〔附表格式第9号〕<2021年7月12日新增>"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "9444b0a00a812f655b27d369eb4c26c19b67484b28bc7411ca01f82e11d76532",
      "target_id": "XML:1803038",
      "text": "法人名称（姓名）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "7e53d842dd0fd3a5f45f9a5162eb0ddefccb0e462c2c1c38b1e4f0d5a81dd547",
      "target_id": "XML:1803039",
      "text": "营业（法人）登记号码"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "261b57a79be08234e7fecc714416fc5066fe557c83f23b6ae778c5c825138510",
      "target_id": "XML:1803042",
      "text": "代表人姓名"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "55fa9f20eb47cc9f9fe2ca2fc9f80c7019fceed7ed10fb6567a7f997c1f14f7b",
      "target_id": "XML:1803047",
      "text": "主要内容"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "6ef4ec1fa8c0370cb37a98ab747c7c1284e4a6dcdcad04c1ba0c95fc7a26c9e3",
      "target_id": "XML:1803048",
      "text": "法令整备"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "dee748bf2f73cca74894cf545fcd0a84624178b31e5aa6d818ed85b492aba9ab",
      "target_id": "XML:1803051",
      "text": "请求修订的法令"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "e7e19bf14b58dd3026fc8736155aa56ae6ed8e2094ee4e742c63d55ea0f46e06",
      "target_id": "XML:1803052",
      "text": "根据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第53条之3第3款、同法施行令第58条之3第4款及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "bfbb6ecf85cfe73dace914b67695426df9be44d55f175ef85baeef2207cc3c32",
      "target_id": "XML:1803053",
      "text": "同法施行细则第6条第2款，特此签发上述法令整备请求确认书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "a21a492062e62efa9f735bc7cecc3928a79664c92c76a53b207d0d0fe7cd387a",
      "target_id": "XML:1803054",
      "text": "根据同法第53条之3第8款，1. 在认定无需进行法令整备，或者虽认定需要整备法令但"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "9ef91d9c852ef3e5cf4d5a4a47fc3fe4df64f40fd20261420fbc9f77753ea916",
      "target_id": "XML:1803055",
      "text": "因其他法律明确禁止而不符合智能创新事业申请条件的情况下，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "9c85f16e1b8d23ed7361e12b88bfed91fc7c9f82c1f8ae4f1374afdadaf5d1ce",
      "target_id": "XML:1803056",
      "text": "示范期间视为延长至收到附表格式第10号所列法令整备审查结果书之日；"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "295413f4ab1cd37aecdcf97c4178b1c1e08550375805e32f3be252073d9d52c7",
      "target_id": "XML:1803057",
      "text": "2. 根据同法第53条之3第7款可以批准智能创新事业的，示范期间视为延长至该事业获批准之日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "d41b670a9eff7a595f0c8600bbdc8f4ceef794ca7e87b8d4ce73d701d8501d29",
      "target_id": "XML:1803058",
      "text": "特此告知。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25473-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "5d198bb5e838918707a8044806bdf8567e7d1a9dde69dc6d15d873ed679d8657",
      "target_id": "XML:1803062",
      "text": "国土交通部长官"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "ae29d7597c5ef8dd37b2e01dc5b81af0412add75aa3abff7478da16e43de4016",
      "target_id": "XML:1803065",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》施行细则〔附表格式第10号〕<2021年7月12日新增>"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "823121d174aebb77a642f142ec5c2902e77994a8525ed47ce3ef0714b197fc1e",
      "target_id": "XML:1803066",
      "text": "法令整备审查结果书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "2a25c518199d0cd393b9da8f27268bba9d3a6e9276573509cbb9b2e3cebf0bf8",
      "target_id": "XML:1803067",
      "text": "审查对象事项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "55fa9f20eb47cc9f9fe2ca2fc9f80c7019fceed7ed10fb6567a7f997c1f14f7b",
      "target_id": "XML:1803071",
      "text": "主要内容"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "085bbf8840b5bd20723df5fabce60dd5b8b6f9c387e0d30624a1e9f6a8ca316c",
      "target_id": "XML:1803072",
      "text": "适用规制特例及规制改进的对象法令"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "31b92fb4917f6a016fa99adf294fcb01828e5c133e43890099239d1e1b2619ab",
      "target_id": "XML:1803073",
      "text": "法令整备审查意见"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "1598ff00c2cdf0924ff3ab9b148c77c54693db6807ca02a244bc2bdb253b883f",
      "target_id": "XML:1803074",
      "text": "规制主管部门"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "27167a8a3661bfdea948eada424948f7e3aad1a26f73569912edf2456c6f03cf",
      "target_id": "XML:1803075",
      "text": "承办部门"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "6621f04cce2ad0ac55ea663868d600f9578750d62392a47652711655b61ae620",
      "target_id": "XML:1803076",
      "text": "审查意见"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "dd5d6f518ba04782ecbe0b5e8b121d092b392707439122764b26fde35d9eec82",
      "target_id": "XML:1803077",
      "text": "审查意见详情"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "ee1ea32bb06f4b802cf35e9ba2025e2aad8fbc3ff35cacab72fca36a9c27478d",
      "target_id": "XML:1803078",
      "text": "法令制定及修订计划"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "8c55adf6bd280b3b0b67dc03dfa64ca7c0591cd971ccdfc0153a3083ddfd0c89",
      "target_id": "XML:1803079",
      "text": "根据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》施行令第58条之3第7款及同法施行细则第6条第3款，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "5d30dbf297c4bc3091fd8f3b4c7d98bde5d798aa5da931e902429c8b361752c4",
      "target_id": "XML:1803080",
      "text": "特此通知上述法令整备审查结果。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25474-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "5d198bb5e838918707a8044806bdf8567e7d1a9dde69dc6d15d873ed679d8657",
      "target_id": "XML:1803084",
      "text": "国土交通部长官"
    }
  ],
